WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.350
Rest. Without watching the clock.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:09.720
Tap Made and the rest timer starts on its own. The ring counts down while you chalk up. Put the phone down.

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:16.436
To rest longer, add thirty seconds. You can reset it, or skip the rest when you are ready.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:21.033
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
